    schema:title "Area Director - Southeast London" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/ivcevidensia/area-director-southeast-london-sidcup-kent-england-140857> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-assistenz-der-geschaftsfuhrung-operations-montabaur-472153> a prov:Entity,
