    schema:title "Head of Research Lab" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/stealth-robotics-startup/head-of-research-lab-munich-164894> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-head-of-revops-brighton-hove-264434> a prov:Entity,
