    schema:datePosted "2026-08-18"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><strong>About WPP Media</strong></p> <p>WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. </p> <p>WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.</p> <p>For more information, visit <a href=\"wppmedia.com\">wppmedia.com</a>.</p></div><p><strong>3124 - Network Operations Director - GCS</strong></p> <p><strong>Role Summary &amp; Impact</strong></p> <p>The Network Connection Director plays a pivotal role in driving operational excellence across the Unilever account, ensuring teams are connected, aligned, and operating at maximum effectiveness to deliver exceptional client and business outcomes. Responsible for analysing and optimising processes across a complex global network, this role identifies opportunities to streamline workflows, improve resource utilisation, enhance collaboration, and embed a culture of continuous improvement.</p> <p>Working closely with leadership and cross-functional teams, the Network Connection Director leverages data, insights, and best practices to improve efficiency, strengthen governance, and ensure alignment with strategic business objectives. Through proactive risk management, performance reporting, and operational oversight, they drive measurable improvements in team effectiveness, project delivery, and organisational productivity. By championing scalable ways of working and fostering a high-performing, connected culture, the role enables the wider organisation to adapt, evolve, and consistently deliver outstanding commercial and client results.</p> <p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p> <ol> <li><strong>Process Optimisation</strong></li> <ul> <li>Analyse current workflows and identify opportunities for improvement.</li> <li>Implement streamlined processes to reduce inefficiencies and enhance productivity.</li> <li>Leverage automation tools and best practices to optimise operational tasks.</li> </ul> <li><strong>Team Efficiency</strong></li> <ul> <li>Monitor team performance metrics and identify bottlenecks.</li> <li>Develop strategies to maximise resource utilisation across teams.</li> <li>Foster cross-functional collaboration to ensure smooth project delivery.</li> </ul> <li><strong>Continuous Improvement</strong></li> <ul> <li>Create and maintain a culture of continuous improvement across the organisation.</li> <li>Conduct regular process reviews and update documentation accordingly.</li> <li>Train and mentor team members on optimised practices and methodologies.</li> </ul> <li><strong>Operational Alignment</strong></li> <ul> <li>Align team goals with broader organisational objectives to ensure cohesive efforts.</li> <li>Collaborate with leadership to set clear priorities and deliverables.</li> <li>Provide regular progress reports and insights to stakeholders.</li> </ul> <li><strong>Risk Management and Problem Solving</strong></li> <ul> <li>Identify potential risks associated with process inefficiencies and address them proactively.</li> <li>Act as a point of escalation for operational challenges and lead resolution efforts.</li> </ul> <li><strong>Performance Reporting</strong></li> <ul> <li>Monitor and track project deliverables &amp; performance across all teams.</li> <li>Manage and report on the team’s KPIs to measure success.</li> <li>Use data-driven insights to recommend and implement process enhancements.</li> </ul> </ol> <p><strong>Skills and Experience</strong></p> <ul> <li>Has substantial experience in media, marketing, or the wider creative industries, and is eager to further their career within a global organisation</li> <li>Understands the intricacies of operational processes within large-scale, global teams, and can identify opportunities for improvement</li> <li>Is highly proactive, can take ownership of tasks, and leads with initiative to anticipate the needs of the business</li> <li>Thrives both independently and in a team environment, with strong collaboration skills</li> <li>Is highly organised, with the ability to manage multiple priorities and drive projects to successful completion</li> <li>Is an adept problem solver, comfortable seeking clarity on complex issues, and quick to learn from feedback</li> <li>Demonstrates enthusiasm for challenges and is committed to delivering high-quality outcomes</li> <li>Proficiency in Microsoft Office suite and other relevant tools</li> <li>Strong organisational and project management skills, with the ability to streamline processes and optimise workflows</li> <li>Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to convey complex ideas clearly</li> <li>Logical thinking, strategic problem-solving abilities, and a deep understanding of operational efficiency</li> <li>Proven experience in managing teams or providing senior-level support across multiple functions</li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Life at WPP Media &amp; Benefits</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Championing Growth and Development</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Create an Open environment</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we're together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That's why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location</span></em><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Please read our Privacy Notice (</span><a href=\"https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy</span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">)</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">#LI-Promoted</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p></p> <p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-CA\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8\">Please read our <a href=\"https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment\">Privacy Notice</a></span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-CA\" data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;<span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8\">for more information on how we process the information you provide.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-wppmedia ;
