    schema:title "People Operations Coordinator" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/montu-uk/people-operations-coordinator-london-341912> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-platform-and-integration-engineer-security-telemetry-32h-berlin-447900> a prov:Entity,
