            schema:name "London" ] ;
    schema:title "Senior Finance Operations Manager (12 month FTC)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/kaluza/senior-finance-operations-manager-12-month-ftc-london-85751> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-senior-financial-crime-investigator-business-banking-279018> a prov:Entity,
