            schema:name "Frankfurt" ] ;
    schema:title "Senior Software Developer & Development Coordinator (m/w/d) – .NET & AI-gestützte Produktentwicklung" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/qualityhosting-gmbh/senior-software-developer-development-coordinator-net-ai-gestutzte-produktentwicklung-frankfurt-459907> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-senior-software-developer-in-ci-munich-52426> a prov:Entity,
